{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "150bf8df5ed01a1a19e7b0d6465d18f9", "text": "Mapping in progress | Awareness", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "6d434ce5d25f3ec6177112d2e096a4a6", "text": "_As a user, I want to know if a map is in progress, even if I navigate away from the mapping results page, so that no matter where I am in the product, I know if I am using credits._", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "ListItem", "element_id": "785ab96d25223911a705ecbf384ea107", "text": "UI Suggestion:", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "51b94d929a77ec28b6aa6733c6e0e14f", "text": "We need this UI to be eye catching enough that it does help the user notice when mapping is on/off, but not so eye catching that it is distracting.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "0b418a52b9829b50021c2adc7e342f37", "text": "The navigation bar is present on every screen in the product, in this include;", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "ListItem", "element_id": "734f9e10c08f384be54f440be4972a43", "text": "For beta; clear text to indicate what is happening (example; Mapping in progress, Mapping not in progress) and, an icon to indicate progress (A spinner icon or similar", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "ListItem", "element_id": "7983312d16e0aa375df07b6ff3eea746", "text": "although this may be too distracting) OR a status (of on/off).", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "ListItem", "element_id": "ca195330a44e26ef86c30f15b41ce726", "text": "Post beta; consider adding a drop down from the above that shows each map in progress, with a progress % and an arrow the user can click to take them to that map.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "c3d9e360c8959b81f141e2e514418574", "text": "_Basic concept attached below._", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "16141.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "30a2a21d1964109cd0b8a54ae56f569b", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "16141", "key": "MAP-188", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": null, "date_modified": null, "date_processed": "1744461415.044797", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 1699}}}
